{"id":"n86798-1-7","stage":4,"title":"허술하다 · 破旧","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86798-1-7-1","ko":"아버지, 천장에서 물이 새요.","zh":"爸爸，天花板在漏水。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지,","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"천장에서","meaning":"顶棚，天棚","explanation":"천장：顶棚，天棚；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"천장","audio":"/audio/c80d260f8de85a6ed343.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24944","senseId":"1","lemma":"천장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새요.","meaning":"漏","explanation":"새다：漏；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"새다","audio":"/audio/d152606bd862b7092fd5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16231","senseId":"1","lemma":"새다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"c80d260f8de85a6e","term":"천장","zh":"顶棚，天棚","audio":"/audio/c80d260f8de85a6ed343.mp3","entryId":"24944","definition":"一座建筑物的室内顶部。","pronunciation":["천장"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"d152606bd862b709","term":"새다","zh":"漏","audio":"/audio/d152606bd862b7092fd5.mp3","entryId":"16231","definition":"气体或液体从缝或洞里泄出去。","pronunciation":["새다"]}],"audio":"/audio/20782c5546d50fc7602b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86798-1-7-2","ko":"집의 허술한 곳을 좀 고쳐야겠구나.","zh":"得把房子里那些破旧的地方修一修了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집의","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"허술한","meaning":"破旧，褴褛","explanation":"허술하다：破旧，褴褛；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"허술하다","audio":"/audio/3bfff3241c19ec86737e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86798","senseId":"1","lemma":"허술하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳을","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고쳐야겠구나.","meaning":"修补，维修","explanation":"고치다：修补，维修；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"고치다","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18381","senseId":"1","lemma":"고치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"房子，窝，巢","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人或动物为了遮寒挡暑等，进里面生活而盖的建筑物。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"3bfff3241c19ec86","term":"허술하다","zh":"破旧，褴褛","audio":"/audio/3bfff3241c19ec86737e.mp3","entryId":"86798","definition":"老而破，没有值得看的东西。","pronunciation":["허술하다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"594fd99add1f497b","term":"고치다","zh":"修补，维修","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3","entryId":"18381","definition":"修理出故障或不能用的东西，使其可重新使用。","pronunciation":["고치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6d9099bd20c23fc764b8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.731,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86798","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5577,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["爸爸，天花板在漏水。","得把房子里那些破旧的地方修一修了。","智秀，你去参加教授的葬礼了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["爸爸，天花板在漏水。","得把房子里那些破旧的地方修一修了。","智秀，你去参加教授的葬礼了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
